    Bound retrograde tests to n<=3 exhaustive + targeted n=4
    
    Keep the regression test under 5s: exhaustive validation only for n<=3,
    plus targeted n=4 posets (antichain S(4)=5, chain, five structured
    posets) and the depth-5 certificate. Move the comprehensive n=4 sweep to
    the offline script path (validate(n_max=4)) and document it as excluded
    from CI. Also state explicitly that the reverse transition graph is
    offline-built over all enumerated states, not the source's true
    Hasse-edge predecessor generation.

